1. intellij-flix -- Flix language layer (grammar, lexer, parser, PSI, editor)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Origin:   https://github.com/flix/intellij-flix (plugin id org.flixlang.intellij)
Revision: 375dcc661d95a93d66b262b8365459121913efbb
Tree:     fcd45b6f7dcbc30284b1f893cbb219737db3a0ba
License:  Apache License 2.0

The following are imported into this repository and retain their original
`org.flixlang.intellij` package names so that the imported layer stays
reviewable against, and re-synchronizable with, its origin:

  src/main/grammar/Flix.bnf
  src/main/grammar/_Flix.flex
  src/main/grammar/Flix.tokens.txt
  org.flixlang.intellij.lang.**        (language, file type, parser definition,
                                        PSI, editor support, highlighting)
  org.flixlang.intellij.run.FlixRunLineMarkerContributor
  the associated language, editor and gutter tests

Not imported: the compiler downloader/settings/service, the native
`com.intellij.platform.lsp` integration, the standalone run configurations, and
the introduce/inline refactorings. See docs/adr/0001-single-language-owner.md.

