2. Flix compiler -- source of the grammar and token inventory
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Origin:   https://github.com/flix/flix
License:  Apache License 2.0

`Flix.bnf`, `_Flix.flex` and `Flix.tokens.txt` are a hand re-derivation of the
Flix compiler's authoritative parser and lexer:

  main/src/ca/uwaterloo/flix/language/phase/Parser2.scala
  main/src/ca/uwaterloo/flix/language/phase/Lexer.scala
  main/src/ca/uwaterloo/flix/language/ast/SyntaxTree.scala
  main/src/ca/uwaterloo/flix/language/ast/TokenKind.scala

The pinned upstream revision used to derive and validate them is recorded in
`gradle.properties` as `flixCorpusCommit`, and is verified by the
`checkFlixCorpusPin` Gradle task. The parser corpus evaluation that gates this
derivation is documented in docs/intellij-flix-parser-evaluation.md.

